sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User as 🧑 User
    participant Gateway as 🌐 API Gateway
    participant Identity as 👤 Identity Service
    participant CRM as 🔗 CRM Connector
    participant Scenario as 🎭 Scenario Generator
    participant Orchestrator as 🕹 Simulation Orchestrator
    participant AIChat as 🤖 Text Chat AI
    participant Feedback as 📝 Feedback Engine
    participant Analytics as 📊 Analytics
    participant Media as 🎙 Media Service
    participant RQ as 🟩 RabbitMQ (Events)

    %% Login flow
    User->>Gateway: Login request
    Gateway->>Identity: Authenticate & fetch user/org/plan
    Identity-->>Gateway: JWT + org context
    Gateway-->>User: Authenticated session

    %% CRM context
    Gateway->>CRM: Fetch CRM contacts/opportunities
    CRM-->>Gateway: CRM data
    Gateway-->>User: CRM insights available

    %% Scenario generation
    User->>Gateway: Start training session
    Gateway->>Scenario: Request scenario
    Scenario-->>Gateway: Scenario template
    Gateway->>Orchestrator: Create new session
    Orchestrator-->>User: Session ready

    %% Simulation multi-turn
    loop Each user turn
        User->>Gateway: Send message
        Gateway->>Orchestrator: Forward message
        Orchestrator->>AIChat: Generate AI response
        AIChat-->>Orchestrator: Response
        Orchestrator-->>User: AI reply
    end

    %% Simulation ends
    Orchestrator-->>RQ: Emit simulation.completed

    %% Feedback + Analytics
    RQ-->>Feedback: simulation.completed
    Feedback-->>RQ: feedback.ready
    RQ-->>Analytics: simulation + feedback events
    Feedback-->>User: Scorecard + suggestions
    Analytics-->>User: Dashboard updated

    %% Media ingestion (optional)
    User->>Gateway: Upload real sales call
    Gateway->>Media: Store file
    Media-->>RQ: media.ingested
    RQ-->>Analytics: Update stats with media reference
